  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "eff705a436adfe6c0524fe4a2b564230",
    "text": "As a user I want to work across multiple frameworks",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18888.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "ea15c0d4a7c6efe893a8e03fbd81d515",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18888",
          "key": "MAP-596",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-28T01:45:21.634+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-03-28T01:45:22.213+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3852818",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1019
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "f1997f2192dfc7904e19c16a51d83508",
    "text": "A user may have multiple frameworks they want to work with.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18888.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "ea15c0d4a7c6efe893a8e03fbd81d515",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18888",
          "key": "MAP-596",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-28T01:45:21.634+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-03-28T01:45:22.213+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3852818",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1019
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "dee4416bab19923cba029e293f4c886a",
    "text": "There are two types of frameworks. Industry frameworks that we create, and custom frameworks that users create.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18888.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "ea15c0d4a7c6efe893a8e03fbd81d515",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18888",
          "key": "MAP-596",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-28T01:45:21.634+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-03-28T01:45:22.213+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3852818",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1019
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "f28105700eb6a7800abfc3a07ef926a9",
    "text": "This card covers the experience of how users navigate between and work with multiple frameworks. How we create the frameworks if covered elsewhere.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
